graph TD
    A[Suspicious Email / Artifact Input] --> B{Input Validation}
    B -- Invalid / Exceeds 10MB --> B1[Graceful 400/413 Error]
    B -- Valid .eml / Raw / URL / File --> C[Safe Static Extraction Engine]
    
    subgraph Extraction["Artifact & Content Extraction (No Execution)"]
        C --> D1[Header Extractor: From, Reply-To, Return-Path, SPF/DKIM/DMARC]
        C --> D2[Body Sanitizer: Strip HTML to Safe Text, Extract Links]
        C --> D3[URL Parser: IP Host, Userinfo, Lexical Obfuscation]
        C --> D4[Attachment Inspector: SHA-256 Digest, Magic Bytes vs MIME]
    end

    subgraph Detection["Modular Detection Engine"]
        D1 --> E1[EMAIL-001 / EMAIL-002: Identity & Domain Mismatch]
        D2 --> E2[EMAIL-003 / EMAIL-004: Credential & Financial Urgency]
        D3 --> E3[URL-001 / URL-002 / URL-003: Structure, IP Host, Link Text]
        D4 --> E4[ATTACH-001 / ATTACH-002 / ATTACH-003: Risky Ext, Signature, Known Hash]
    end

    E1 & E2 & E3 & E4 --> F[CORR-001: Indicator Correlation Engine]
    F --> G[Explainable Risk Scorer (0 - 100)]
    
    subgraph Decision["Safeguards & Classification"]
        G --> H1{Score >= 60 & Multi-Ind / Strong Intel?}
        H1 -- Yes --> I1[Classification: MALICIOUS (High Risk)]
        H1 -- No, Single Weak Anomaly --> I2[Classification: SUSPICIOUS (Damped Safeguard)]
        G --> H2{Score 30-59 or Active Threat Finding?}
        H2 -- Yes --> I2
        G --> H3{Malformed / Missing Fields?}
        H3 -- Unreliable Extraction --> I3[Classification: MANUAL REVIEW]
        G --> H4{Score 0-29 & No Threat Findings?}
        H4 -- Yes --> I4[Classification: SAFE (Low Risk)]
    end

    I1 & I2 & I3 & I4 --> J[Structured IoC Extractor]
    J --> K[(SQLite / PostgreSQL Persistence)]
    K --> L[SOC Analyst Dashboard & Report Generator]
    L --> M1[Interactive UI: Visual Gauge, Findings, IoC Copy]
    L --> M2[Downloadable PDF Dossier & JSON/CSV Export]
